WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.792 --> 00:00:25.251
Eddy looked at the new bridge.

2
00:00:25.252 --> 00:00:28.348
"Oh boy!" he said.

3
00:00:28.349 --> 00:00:32.377
He drove closer.

4
00:00:32.378 --> 00:00:34.414
Eddy looked up.

5
00:00:34.415 --> 00:00:37.185
He saw clouds.

6
00:00:37.186 --> 00:00:43.649
Then Eddy looked down.

7
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.853
The ground was far below.

8
00:00:46.854 --> 00:00:48.925
There was a river.

9
00:00:48.926 --> 00:00:51.140
It looked tiny.

10
00:00:51.141 --> 00:00:55.456
Eddy gulped.

11
00:00:55.457 --> 00:00:59.444
"We're up very high!" he thought.

12
00:00:59.445 --> 00:01:04.012
"Who's going first?" Ms. Fender asked.

13
00:01:04.013 --> 00:01:07.141
"Not me!" said Dipper.

14
00:01:07.142 --> 00:01:10.650
"Not me!" said Jeb.

15
00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:13.831
"Not me!" said Poppy.

16
00:01:13.832 --> 00:01:16.351
"The bridge is too high!"

17
00:01:16.352 --> 00:01:20.181
"Don't be scared," said Ms. Fender.

18
00:01:20.182 --> 00:01:26.964
"The bridge is very safe."

19
00:01:26.965 --> 00:01:32.843
Then Ms. Fender saw Eddy.

20
00:01:32.844 --> 00:01:36.506
"Oh, Eddy!" said Ms. Fender.

21
00:01:36.507 --> 00:01:48.074
"You don't seem scared.

22
00:01:48.075 --> 00:01:54.167
Do you want to go first?"
